        ("World Bank -- Development Policy Operation", "https://www.worldbank.org/en/news/press-release/2025/07/03/world-bank-steps-up-support-for-ethiopia-economic-reforms-with-1-billion-development-policy-operation"),
        ("SWP Berlin -- UAE Engagement in Ethiopia", "https://www.swp-berlin.org/assets/afrika/publications/policybrief/MTA-PB35_UAE_Engagement_in_Ethiopia_Gebru.pdf"),
        ("Horn Review -- Ethiopia weighing Saudi overtures", "https://hornreview.org/2026/02/11/ethiopia-weighing-saudi-overtures-amid-gulf-rivalry/"),
        ("Ecofin Agency -- Eurobond restructuring deal", "https://www.ecofinagency.com/news-finances/3006-56913-ethiopia-and-bondholders-reach-new-preliminary-deal-on-1-billion-eurobond-restructuring"),
